From: Rust on C28x
Subject: [PATCH] Add C28x target (c28x-none-elf)

Add TI C2000 C28x support to rustc 1.100 (nightly-2026-09-14).
FROZEN ABI: 32-bit logical byte pointers (see ABI_FREEZE.md).

Changes:
  compiler/rustc_llvm/build.rs                            |  1 +
  compiler/rustc_llvm/src/lib.rs                          |  7 +
  compiler/rustc_target/src/callconv/mod.rs               |  2 +
  compiler/rustc_target/src/spec/targets/c28x_none_elf.rs | 47 +++++++++++
  compiler/rustc_target/src/spec/mod.rs                   |  1 +
  5 files changed, 58 insertions(+)

